SJF: Job 0 -- Response: 0.00 Turnaround 100.00 Wait 0.00 Job 1 -- Response: 100.00 Turnaround 300.00 Wait 100.00 1
Job 2 -- Response: 300.00 Turnaround 600.00 Wait 300.00
FIFO: Job 0 -- Response: 0.00 Turnaround 100.00 Wait 0.00 Job 1 -- Response: 100.00 Turnaround 300.00 Wait 100.00 Job 2 -- Response: 300.00 Turnaround 600.00 Wait 300.00 When I change the order of jobs, the result of SJF remains the same, but the result of FIFO does change according to the new order.

